  "description": "Material Design Icons (MDI) inline-SVG resolver for NuStreamDocs. Plugs into the icon-shortcode rewriter to inline MDI SVGs directly into rendered HTML — matches mkdocs-material's :material-foo: shape so docs that target the MDI name space (~7000 icons) render the right glyph instead of a font-ligature span. Uses a precompiled byte-keyed FrozenDictionary alternate-lookup so per-page resolution stays allocation-free.",
